@startuml
title SMS Delivery Callback - Business Process

actor "SMS Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Request Throttler" as Throttler
participant "SMS Callback Service" as Service
database "Audit Database" as AuditDB

Gateway -> Throttler: Submit delivery callback

Throttler -> Throttler: Check request capacity

alt Capacity available

    Throttler -> Service: Forward callback

    Service -> Service: Authenticate and validate callback

    alt Valid callback

        Service -> Service: Process delivery status
        Service -> AuditDB: Record processing outcome
        Service --> Throttler: Processing result
    |||
    else Invalid callback
    |||
        Service --> Throttler: Validation failure
   |||
    end
    |||
else Capacity exceeded
|||
    Throttler --> Gateway: Request rejected
|||
end

Throttler --> Gateway: Response

@enduml